---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions - SavoFinance">
  
  <div class="w-full bg-white text-slate-900 min-h-screen pt-24 pb-24 px-4 md:px-24">
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      
      {/* HEADER SECTION */}
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
          Terms & Conditions
        </h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light text-sm">
          Last updated: June 2, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-100 mb-10" />

      {/* LEGAL CONTENT SECTION */}
      <div class="text-gray-600 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed font-normal space-y-8">
        
        <p>
          Welcome to <strong>SavoFinance</strong>. By accessing and using this website, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions of use, which together with our privacy policy govern SavoFinance's relationship with you in relation to this website.
        </p>

        {/* SECTION 1 */}
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
            1. Acceptance of Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 font-light">
            By accessing or using any part of the website, you agree to become bound by the terms and conditions of this agreement. If you do not agree to all the terms and conditions of this agreement, then you may not access the website or use any services.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* SECTION 2 */}
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
            2. Financial Disclaimer
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 font-light">
            All content, analysis, simulations, and educational materials presented on SavoFinance are provided purely for general informational and educational purposes only. Nothing contained on our site constitutes a solicitation, recommendation, endorsement, or offer by SavoFinance to buy or sell any financial instruments. You assume the sole responsibility of evaluating the merits and risks associated with the use of any information.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* SECTION 3 */}
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
            3. Intellectual Property
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 font-light">
            This website contains material which is owned by or licensed to us. This material includes, but is not limited to, the design, layout, look, appearance, digital products, and graphics. Reproduction is prohibited other than in accordance with the copyright notice, which forms part of these terms and conditions.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* SECTION 4 */}
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
            4. Limitation of Liability
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 font-light">
            In no event will SavoFinance, or its suppliers or licensors, be liable with respect to any subject matter of this agreement under any contract, negligence, strict liability or other legal or equitable theory for: (i) any special, incidental or consequential damages; (ii) the cost of procurement for substitute products or services; or (iii) for interruption of use or loss or corruption of data.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* SECTION 5 */}
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
            5. Changes to Terms
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 font-light">
            SavoFinance reserves the right, at its sole discretion, to modify or replace any part of this Agreement. It is your responsibility to check this Agreement periodically for changes. Your continued use of or access to the website following the posting of any changes to this Agreement constitutes acceptance of those changes.
          </p>
        </div>

        {/* SECTION 6 */}
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-3 tracking-tight">
            6. Contact Information
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-500 font-light">
            If you have any questions about these Terms and Conditions, please contact us at support@savofinance.com.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>